OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court charged with
OL,4,Amurdering his father after body
OL,5,Adiscovered in flat
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 33-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,8,Fcharged with murdering his 53-year-old
OL,9,Ffather, police have confirmed.
OL,11,FMartin Joseph Ward, from Holyhead,
OL,12,FAnglesey, was arrested after the body
OL,13,Fwas discovered inside a flat and
OL,14,Fpronounced dead at the scene in the
OL,15,Fearly hours of 17 October.
OL,17,FHe appeared at Llandudno Magistrates'
OL,18,FCourt on Monday wearing a grey jumper
OL,19,Fand only spoke to confirm his name,
OL,20,Fdate of birth and that he understood
OL,21,Fthat his case was being transferred to
OL,22,Fthe crown court.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
