OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court charged with
OL,4,Amurdering his father after body
OL,5,Adiscovered in flat
OL,6,
OL,7,FDistrict Judge Gwyn Jones told him he
OL,8,Fmust stay in custody and would next
OL,9,Fappear before Caernarfon Crown Court on
OL,10,FTuesday.
